  triad: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1e2f3041526378495a6b7c8d9e0f2a1, type: 2}
  prologue: "The pillar in Rivia cracked. The villagers did not cheer; they watched
    the book in Theo's hands as if it might bite. The Wildwood had already begun
    to grow inward, hungry for the next sentence.\n\nAthena offered three more laws
    before the trees closed."
  deathLine: The Wildwood wrote Theo into its roots. Athena pulled him back, scowling
    at the margin.
  tutorialText: Shift or J to dash if you kept Aegis Dash.
